{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113417","id":3061420696,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc62eZKY","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113417","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113417.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113417.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113417","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113417/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113417/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113417/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/68ab8f3d02a8d5273123ff05a0a04d4feea6dead","number":113417,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Apply default renderer setting immediately in Project Manager","user":{"login":"Eshaan-byte","id":146680427,"node_id":"U_kgDOCL4qaw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146680427?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eshaan-byte","html_url":"https://github.com/Eshaan-byte","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eshaan-byte/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eshaan-byte/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eshaan-byte/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eshaan-byte/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eshaan-byte/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eshaan-byte/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eshaan-byte/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eshaan-byte/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eshaan-byte/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #113362\r\n\r\nThe default renderer setting (`project_manager/default_renderer`) was only read during `ProjectDialog` initialization, so changes made in Settings would not take effect until the Project Manager was restarted.\r\n\r\n## Changes\r\nThe setting is now re-read each time the \"Create New Project\" dialog is shown, applying the current value immediately.\r\n\r\n  Before:\r\n- Setting read once during dialog initialization\r\n- Changes required restarting Project Manager to take effect\r\n\r\n  After:\r\n- Setting read every time Create dialog opens\r\n- Changes apply immediately when creating new project\r\n\r\n## Implementation\r\nAdded code in `show_dialog()` for `MODE_NEW` that:\r\n1. Reads the current `project_manager/default_renderer` setting\r\n2. Updates the selected renderer button to match\r\n3. Calls `_renderer_selected()` to update the UI\r\n\r\n## Impact\r\n- Users can change default renderer and immediately see it reflected when creating projects\r\n- No restart required for this setting to take effect\r\n- More intuitive user experience\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_